## Interface: 120100, 120105, 16001
## Title: Highground Bounties
## Notes: Personal and guild bounties: an alert when a bounty target shows up, coins on their nameplates, a bounty board and a nearby-enemies list. Retail and WoW Forever.
## Author: kemicofa
## Version: 0.1.0
## OptionalDeps: Highground
